{
  "schema": "clinicalcraft/room-template@1",
  "id": "sc-or-integrated",
  "name": {"zh-CN": "一体化数字手术室（Ⅱ级洁净）", "en": "Integrated digital OR (Class II)"},
  "description": {"zh-CN": "9 × 9 m（81 m²）一体化数字手术室，用于普外、腔镜与急诊手术：层流送风天花与末端高效过滤、双吊塔、4K/3D 腹腔镜塔、两台吊臂 4K 显示器、墙嵌 PACS 屏、环境控制面板（温湿度、压差、层流状态、气体报警）与 WHO 手术安全核查板；四周下回风口，双开感应门。设计目标：GB 50333 Ⅱ级（手术区 ISO 6）、ASHRAE 170（≥ 20 次/h 总换气、≥ 4 次/h 新风、对走廊正压、20–24 °C、20–60 % RH）。", "en": "9 × 9 m (81 m²) integrated digital OR for general, minimally invasive and emergency surgery: laminar-flow supply ceiling with terminal HEPA filters, anaesthesia and surgical pendants, a 4K/3D laparoscopy tower, two ceiling-boom 4K displays, a wall PACS screen, the room control panel (temperature, humidity, pressure, laminar-flow status, gas alarms) and the WHO Surgical Safety Checklist; low-level returns and sensor-operated sliding doors. Design targets: GB 50333 Class II (ISO 6 at the operating zone) and ASHRAE 170 (≥ 20 total and ≥ 4 outdoor air changes per hour, positive to the corridor, 20–24 °C, 20–60 % RH)."},
  "kind": "operating-room",
  "size": {"w": 9, "d": 9},
  "floor": "sc-or-floor",
  "partitions": [
    {"side": "n", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 2.6, "width": 1.6, "height": 2.6}]},
    {"side": "w", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 3.1, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}, {"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": -1.2, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}]},
    {"side": "e", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": 3.1, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}, {"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": -1.2, "width": 1.4, "height": 2.6}]},
    {"side": "s", "material": "sc-or-wall", "base": "sc-or-wall-base", "height": 4.6, "openings": [{"kind": "sliding-door", "offset": -2.2, "width": 2.4, "height": 3}]}
  ],
